ow the road to this spot."}, [25]={npc="Mountaineer Cobbleflint", tgt="Mountaineer Cobbleflint", desc="Carefully drop down to the ledge ahead, then down to the ground."}, [26]={npc="Captain Rugelfuss", tgt="Captain Rugelfuss"}, [27]={node="Thelsamar"}, [28]={desc="If Ironforge isn't on your flight map, head west through the pass back to Dun Morogh and walk straight to Kharanos."}, [29]={npc="Grif Wildheart", tgt="Grif Wildheart"}, [30]={hint="Use the Taming Rod to tame a Large Crag Boar. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Grif Wildheart in Kharanos."}, [31]={npc="Grif Wildheart", tgt="Grif Wildheart"}, [32]={npc="Grif Wildheart", tgt="Grif Wildheart"}, [33]={hint="Use the Taming Rod to tame a Snow Leopard. Practice your skills, then return to Grif Wildheart in Kharanos."}, [34]={npc="Grif Wildheart", tgt="Grif Wildheart"}, [35]={npc="Grif Wildheart", tgt="Grif Wildheart"}, [36]={hint="Use the Taming Rod to tame an Ice Claw Bear. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Grif Wildheart in Kharanos."}, [37]={npc="Grif Wildheart", tgt="Grif Wildheart"}, [38]={npc="Grif Wildheart", tgt="Grif Wildheart"}, [39]={text="Hunters: tame any pet you like. A boar is recommended (Charge pulls fast)."}, [40]={npc="Belia Thundergranite", tgt="Belia Thundergranite"}, [42]={hint="Mountaineer Cobbleflint of the southern guard tower wants you to kill 10 Stonesplinter Troggs and 10 Stonesplinter Scouts."}, [43]={hint="Bring 8 Trogg Stone Teeth to Captain Rugelfuss in the southern guard tower."}, [44]={npc="Mountaineer Cobbleflint", tgt="Mountaineer Cobbleflint"}, [45]={npc="Mountaineer Gravelgaw", tgt="Mountaineer Gravelgaw"}, [46]={npc="Captain Rugelfuss", tgt="Captain Rugelfuss"}, [47]={node="Thelsamar"}, [48]={text="Set your hearth in the Thelsamar inn (35.40, 48.40).", bind="Thelsamar"}, [49]={npc="Brock Stoneseeker", tgt="Brock Stoneseeker"}, [50]={npc="Mountaineer Kadrell", tgt="Mountaineer Kadrell"}, [51]={npc="Mountaineer Stormpike", tgt="Mountaineer S